WEBVTT

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:55.410
<b>High School Prodigies Have It Easy
Even In Another World!</b>

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.970
Lyrule's been kidnapped?!

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:08.480
<b>It Seems Tsukasa has
\h\h\h\h\h\h\hResolved to Change the World!</b>

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:06.350
Damn it!

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:08.400
That sex-crazed lord!

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:09.850
We don't have time to waste!

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:11.420
Everyone,

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:14.380
let's get to the castle and rescue Lyrule!

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:16.860
Wait a moment.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.610
Let's not do anything rash.

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:21.820
What did you say?!

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:25.590
We're up against the lord 
of Findolf, aren't we?

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:30.080
What you're proposing is tantamount to declaring

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.330
war on a country.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.130
Even if you succeed in rescuing Lyrule,

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.530
he'll just send his forces to crush you.

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:41.470
When he does,

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:43.470
he'll slaughter you all.

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:47.400
Th-Then what are you suggesting we do?!

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.000
I'll go negotiate.

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:51.050
At present,

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:55.740
Lyrule is the only life that the lord values.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:03:02.320
We'll have to sacrifice her to
get him to drop the charge of treason.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:06.080
I promise I can successfully 
negotiate that for you.

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:07.850
You have my guarantee.

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:10.940
You damn bastard!

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:13.930
How can you seriously suggest 
something so messed up?!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.960
Do you think I could joke about 
something this messed-up?!

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:23.310
In this case, that's the best way 
to settle things smoothly.

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:26.820
More importantly, it's probably 
what Lyrule herself would wish.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.310
That's...

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:35.930
You're probably right 
about Lyrule wanting that.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.230
Mom!

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.850
However, Tsukasa,

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:42.570
even if sacrificing her brings 
peace back to our village,

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:45.210
we'll no longer be ourselves.

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:50.330
We'll just be animals doing whatever it takes
to survive, just like the nobles say.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:53.690
Don't you think your survival
comes first and foremost?

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:54.830
We don't.

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:58.140
No matter how disadvantageous it is to us,

00:03:58.140 --> 00:03:59.840
helping and supporting each other

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:02.860
is what makes us human.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.360
So we're going,

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:09.220
in order to retain our humanity.

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.920
You're so silly.

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:21.670
You just had Lyrule treat this.

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:31.200
I'm not devoid of emotions myself, you know.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.070
Tsukasa...

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:36.100
Would you...

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:39.210
please help us with this?

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:43.210
I know we can rescue Lyrule 
if you all are there with us.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.930
So, please...

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:47.720
Please...

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:50.970
help us!

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.320
Once the fighting begins,

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:59.690
mounds of corpses will pile up

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:02.410
and blood will run until the ocean turns red.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.690
You'll face suffering you could've avoided

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:08.950
had you continued to live
 as the nobles' livestock.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:14.830
Are you all willing to face that in 
order to protect your human dignity?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:26.720
Very well.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:31.100
If you're prepared for the consequences, 
then we'll help you.

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:34.730
As a statesman from a democratic nation,

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:38.980
I will help you with your war
and your people's revolution.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:41.730
Tsukasa!

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:55.620
Oh, there's one thing
you need to ask, isn't there?

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.850
Yeah, I know.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:05:59.880
My friends...

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:01.880
While we're more than willing to assist you,

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:06.510
we'll be forced to take this seriously
if we're putting our lives on the line.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:11.890
As a result, we'll be advancing this 
world's civilization by roughly 500 years.

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:14.540
Your politics, your economics, your values,

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.640
everything you know will change.

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:18.830
To put it simply,

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.380
we'll be destroying the world as you know it.

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:24.840
Are you sure you want us to do this?

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:38.330
What a beautiful lady you are!

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.760
She was in the village 
that you ordered torched.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:47.080
I brought her back with me 
as tribute to you, my lord.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:52.520
I expect no less from the greatest 
knight in Findolf, Inzaghi!

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:56.180
I shall allow you to choose 
your reward in the near future.

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:58.520
I'm deeply grateful.

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:04.000
Now, come closer to me.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.700
Yes, my lord.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.320
Oh!

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:22.580
Listen, girl, I'll make you a deal.

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:27.290
If you fulfill your role as the lord's whore,

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:30.090
then I won't touch that village again.

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:33.220
Th-The others are safe?!

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:36.220
I think even an uneducated 
commoner like you knows

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.880
what the wise decision is here.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:45.120
This hair is like silk...

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:46.940
And this skin...

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:50.360
It's so smooth and pleasant to the touch!

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:57.950
<i>If my sacrifice...</i>

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:07.130
<i>can protect my precious family, then...</i>

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:11.500
My lord...

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:14.380
What is it?

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:19.370
Please, love me to
the fullest extent of your desire.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:25.060
Good, good!

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:45.450
Ow!

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:47.750
Wha?! Magic?!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.030
Impossible.

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:52.360
This woman is a mage?!

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.680
Inzaghi!

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:59.180
Tie up that sow!

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:03.680
That filthy commoner dared to wound me!

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:07.050
She'll pay for this!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.220
<i>Prebearations complete!</i>

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:26.180
<i>Ready to go anytime, bear!</i>

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.100
Roger that.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:31.900
Everyone's in position over here.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:35.340
<i>I'm counting on you, Ringo-kun.</i>

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.240
All right.

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:40.390
Electricity transmission systems, all clear.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.390
Main inverter connected.

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:45.390
Environment variables analyzed.

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:47.390
<i>Adjusting firing angle.</i>

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:49.860
Locked on.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:52.360
Output limiter, off.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:53.860
Rail cannon,

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:58.610
fire!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:07.040
Wh-What?!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.040
What is going on?!

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:15.930
Everyone, infiltrate the courtyard 
through the broken castle wall.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.040
Let's move!

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:25.960
Inzaghi!

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:28.440
The villagers of Elm are charging in!

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:30.780
I-Impossible!

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:32.190
They survived?

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:36.330
Then their goal is rescuing that girl.

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:38.820
Crossbow squad, intercept them!

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:45.420
Shoot every last one of those fools dead!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.580
Fire!

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:54.170
They deflected them?!

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.040
Iron shields?!

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:59.610
No, it can't be! A shield big 
enough to protect the whole body

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:01.580
would be too heavy for anyone to use!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.550
So what is that?!

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:06.680
Incredible, isn't it?

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:09.270
Our genius inventor,

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:13.480
Ohoshi Ringo, didn't just manufacture
any ordinary shields!

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:16.890
She combined the aluminum 
we extracted from bauxite

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:21.320
with magnesium and several 
other metals to create

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:25.310
the super alloy that advanced earth's 
civilization through several eras

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:28.320
with its destructively low production cost

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:32.490
and unparalleled strength despite its mass,

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.730
duralumin!

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:41.970
Given the standard of this world's
civilization, it's a god-mode cheat!

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:44.850
Bring all the damn arrows 
and guns you've got!

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:51.420
What?!

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.860
A sniper?!

00:11:58.650 --> 00:11:59.320
Where?!

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:01.530
Where are they shooting from?!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:05.820
This is...

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:08.330
A-An iron arrow?!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.500
And from that distance?!

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:15.500
Incredible.

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:20.260
I don't feel like I can miss,
even at this distance!

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:22.880
We're only facing a few dozen or so!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.890
We have two hundred men!

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:26.760
Overwhelm them with our numbers!

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:31.770
Art of Strength:

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:33.770
Iron Cutting Flash!

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:41.230
It is a samurai's right to strike.

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:52.030
I'll give you guys a special exhibition

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:55.000
of how Elm's former top hunter does her job!

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:58.720
You fight well, Winona.

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:02.630
I thought I wouldn't be doing anything 
dangerous after I got married,

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:05.690
but this is for Lyrule.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:10.930
Your information gathering 
is impressive, Shinobu.

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:15.290
I'm surprised you know the secret passages, 
as well as the castle's structure.

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:20.440
I figured we might need to turn to force,
so I did some research beforehand.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:25.200
Once you turn that corner, 
you'll be at Findolf's room.

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:33.250
Good grief, that incompetent Inzaghi!

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:37.210
I can't believe he let you get this far.

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:43.770
I am Gale Stafford,
the imperial mage officer.

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:49.720
I shall kill you rebels and 
present your heads to the lord!

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:05.570
Stand your ground!

00:14:05.930 --> 00:14:08.250
Stay together and surround them!

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:10.490
Attack them all at once!

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:14.810
Tsk, I guess there's someone who 
can still think in this situation.

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:19.540
Here he comes!

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:24.910
Nice timing!

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:26.340
Thanks, Prince!

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:28.590
Fear me!

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:30.090
Tremble before me!

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:34.970
You all stand before a great mage!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.850
A-A mage?!

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:50.370
<i>I have to pull this off.</i>

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:53.800
<i>I have to be a man!</i>

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:59.540
Now, accept these gifts from me,
 soldiers of Findolf!

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:00.950
Wh-What?!

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:10.880
What is that colorful smoke?!

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.190
Tell me,

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:16.390
how do you like the taste of my mandragora 
poison bombs, created with my secret arts!

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:18.100
P-Poison?!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.130
R-Retreat!

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:20.280
Retreat!

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:29.430
Why isn't the mage officer coming out 
of the castle to deal with this?!

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:30.520
It can't be!

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:31.660
Men, come with me!

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:32.540
Yes, sir!

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:35.740
He noticed, huh?

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.250
But it's too late now.

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:41.880
H-How?!

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:44.000
Are you telling me you can 
see my invisible blade?!

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.500
I don't need to see it.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:51.760
Your attacks are only an extension 
of the lines you draw with your wand.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.260
H-How do you know that?!

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:57.050
Seeing through such a simple trick

00:15:57.050 --> 00:16:01.690
is easy for the world's top journalist
and kunoichi, you know.

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:05.270
A piece of cake!

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:20.520
Ninja Art: Lightning Flash! Kidding.

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:21.790
You two!

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:25.080
I'll hold them off.

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:27.580
You go on ahead.

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:29.920
Okay. I'm counting on you!

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:31.260
Wait!

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:54.460
Lyrule...

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:58.630
<i>Looks like we managed to 
avoid the worst outcome.</i>

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.740
I-It hit him...

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:09.590
It hit him!

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:17.760
The damn commoners outside 
have gone quiet, too.

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:21.960
I imagine they're all dead.

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:24.270
Fools didn't know their place.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:29.290
Still, what a crazy sow you are,

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:32.260
causing all this commotion.

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:35.530
I'll have to punish you.

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:50.790
Come up from below...

00:17:57.830 --> 00:17:59.500
Step away from Lyrule.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:02.930
Wha?!

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:05.520
How are you standing?!

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:07.380
You got shot!

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:11.690
I'm wearing a protective suit 
woven from aramid fibers.

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:21.220
You can't pierce it with a gun
 that isn't rifled.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.360
I-Impossible!

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:34.460
There's no way a commoner like you 
could possess a miniaturized flintlock!

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:37.880
This handgun can fire another 
six shots in succession.

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.340
Do you understand what that means?

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:45.270
It means I can kill you six times over.

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:48.440
H-H-Hold on!

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:51.630
Y-You want this woman, right?

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:53.470
You can take her back!

00:18:53.470 --> 00:18:55.160
I'll give you money, too!

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:57.650
S-So put that away...

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:00.410
Sorry, but that's not an option.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:04.120
After causing so much violence,

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:08.290
the Freyjagard Empire won't 
let us off, even if you do.

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:12.710
There's no turning back for us.

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:14.210
Wha?!

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.890
The goal of a people's revolution

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:19.310
is to create a nation where all men are equal

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:21.970
and anyone can become
the leader of that nation.

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:27.850
We can't stop until we've built a nation
for the people, by the people,

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:32.300
where everyone has a say in politics 
and shares a collective responsibility.

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:40.360
I-I wondered what you were after, 
and it's such nonsense!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.040
All men are equal?

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:46.200
The emperor will never allow 
such nonsense to stand.

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.600
You'll die.

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:50.920
Every single one of you will die!

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:52.030
In that case,

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:55.750
we'll just claim the emperor's 
head before he can kill us.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:01.820
We're here with the resolve 
to change this world.

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:05.760
And you think you can?

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:08.680
Yes, if that's what the people wish for.

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:15.100
Because that is why politicians exist.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:30.080
Don't worry, it's just a rubber bullet.

00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:35.950
Lyrule, are you all right?

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:37.000
Lyrule!

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.260
Thank goodness.

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:45.510
<i>That's not Lyrule's voice!</i>

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:49.310
I made it in time.

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:54.220
There's no... much... me left.

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:59.720
This world is being consumed

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:06.540
by a giant, evil dragon's mouth...

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.940
Who on earth are you?

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:19.170
Please, save this world, my seven heroes...

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:23.160
Are you the one that summoned us here?!

00:21:29.440 --> 00:21:30.220
Hey!

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:31.190
Hey, you!

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:37.550
Huh?

00:21:37.550 --> 00:21:39.290
Tsukasa?

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:41.750
Lyrule?

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:43.740
Huh?

00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:46.000
Huh?!

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:48.250
Tsukasa, what are you doing here?!

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:48.950
Huh?

00:21:50.020 --> 00:21:51.450
What happened here?!

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:54.230
We came to rescue you.

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:57.220
Everyone from the village is outside.

00:21:57.220 --> 00:21:58.880
Everyone?

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:03.370
Yeah, we stormed the lord's castle 
and have seized control of it.

00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:10.810
I'm the worst.

00:22:11.860 --> 00:22:17.320
You've all just done something terrible,
 but I'm happy...

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:23.350
What you're thinking of is correct.

00:22:23.760 --> 00:22:29.000
From this moment on, we'll have a 
mountain of things to do and consider.

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:33.030
However, we can worry about all that later.

00:22:33.780 --> 00:22:35.080
For now,

00:22:37.300 --> 00:22:39.140
we're just glad that you're safe.

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:44.460
Tsukasa!

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:54.880
Ow!

00:22:54.880 --> 00:22:56.780
Just a little more, and I'll be done.

00:22:57.670 --> 00:23:00.100
Oh, good job, Elch.

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:03.850
Well done.

00:23:04.630 --> 00:23:06.230
You startled me!

00:23:20.210 --> 00:23:24.500
<i>This is the sound of equality and 
freedom being born into this world.</i>

00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:27.610
<i>The first goal we need to reach</i>

00:23:27.610 --> 00:23:30.680
<i>is to be recognized internationally 
as an independent country.</i>

00:23:31.590 --> 00:23:32.580
<i>To do that,</i>

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:38.790
<i>we need a god.</i>
